          <h4 class="font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-indigo-400"></i>
            <span>About RSI</span>
          </h4>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) refers to systems using their own outputs to improve subsequent iterations, including prompts, tool usage, code, evaluations, or training recipes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            In 2026, bounded, layered self-improvement has been reported; complete, unconstrained RSI designing next-generation frontier models has not yet occurred. Three-round songwriting iteration serves merely as an applied demonstration.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs border-t border-slate-800 pt-2">
